    "text": "By William Bazzone ,\n1 hours ago Macon, Ga. (WGXA) — Some homeowners on Meadowbrook Drive in West Macon are speaking out about one house they feel is making their neighborhood dirty and dangerous. Bobbie Womack has lived in the neighborhood for 35 years - but says the house across the street from her has been causing problems for nearly a year. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
